eeded?)</span></p></td></tr></table><h2 class="c34" id="h.xhkwvekril1l"><span class="c25 c46 c59">Scientific Work</span></h2><table class="c27"><tr class="c12"><td class="c57" colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p class="c0"><span class="c3">Relationships</span></p></td><td class="c26" colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p class="c0"><span class="c3">Properties</span></p></td></tr><tr class="c12"><td class="c39" colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p class="c0 c47"><span class="c1"></span></p></td><td class="c44" colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p class="c0"><span class="c16 c46">scientificWork_id (DOI, uri, hash)<br>bibliographicCitation</span></p></td></tr></table><h1 class="c51" id="h.bez9tysu5d9p"><span>New Input Files</span></h1><p class="c9"><span>Still mostly based on </span><span class="c64 c50"><a class="c31" href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://dwc.tdwg.org/terms&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1789506313610256&amp;usg=AOvVaw1W3ymhccLpWSBAHF3y9TXF">DarwinCore</a></span></p><h2 class="c0" id="h.sfg3mcdacq93"><span class="c37 c23">Traits </span><span class="c18 c19 c74">- required elements</span></h2><p class="c0"><span class="c18 c19">dwc:</span><span class="c54 c18 c19">measurementID</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">dwc:</span><span class="c18">occurrenceID </span><span class="c16 c15">optional</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">dwc:verbatimT</span><span class="c18">axonID </span><span class="c15">taxon identifier used by the source, may link to a Taxa file with additional taxonomic data</span><span class="c4">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18 c19">dwc:taxonID</span><span class="c18">&nbsp;</span><span class="c16 c15">taxon identifier represented in the TB reference hierarchy, imported from Taxa file if present</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18 c19">dwc:</span><span class="c18 c19">verbatimScientificName</span><span class="c18">&nbsp;</span><span class="c16 c15">name used by the source</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">tb:</span><span class="c18">infer </span><span class="c16 c15">if true, paint the branch: taxa descending from the tbTaxonMapping should inherit this trait</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">tb:</span><span class="c18">exclude </span><span class="c16 c15">stop branchpainting: descendant taxa should not inherit this trait</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18 c19">dwc:</span><span class="c18 c19">measurementType</span><span class="c18">&nbsp;</span><span class="c15">uri represented in the TB terms file</span><span class="c4">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18 c19">dwc:</span><span class="c18 c19">measurementValue</span><span class="c18">&nbsp;</span><span class="c15">uri represented in the TB terms file</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dwc:measurementRemarks&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">dwc:measurementUnit </span><span class="c15">uri represented in the TB terms file</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">dwc:lifestage </span><span class="c15">uri represented in the </span><span class="c19 c15">TB terms</span><span class="c15">&nbsp;file (not a label)</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">dwc:sex </span><span class="c15">uri represented in the </span><span class="c19 c15">TB terms</span><span class="c15">&nbsp;file (not a label)</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">dwc:statisticalMethod </span><span class="c15">uri represented in the TB terms file</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18 c19">dc:</span><span class="c18 c19">source</span><span class="c18">&nbsp;</span><span class="c15">identifier represented in the TB References file</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">dc:references </span><span class="c15">identifiers represented in the TB References file</span></p><h2 class="c0 c68" id="h.5153pvarjrla"><span class="c25 c37 c23"></span></h2><h2 class="c0" id="h.oibhxsj0t7v8"><span class="c25 c37 c23">Taxa - optional, not harvested into the graph</span></h2><p class="c0"><span class="c18">dwc:</span><span class="c18">taxonID </span><span class="c15">taxon identifier used by the source</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">tb:taxonID </span><span class="c15">taxon identifier represented in the TB reference hierarchy</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">dwc:canonicalName </span><span class="c15">derived from the source</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">dwc:scientificName </span><span class="c15">name used by the source</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">dwc:parentNameUsageID </span><span class="c15">derived from the source</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">dwc:higherClassification </span><span class="c15">derived from the source</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">dwc:kingdom, dwc:phylum, dwc:class, dwc:order, dwc:family, dwc:genus, species </span><span class="c15">derived from the source</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">dwc:taxonRank </span><span class="c15">derived from the source</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dwc:taxonRemarks</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dc:source</span></p><h2 class="c0 c68" id="h.og3nmjii5auo"><span class="c25 c37 c23"></span></h2><h2 class="c0" id="h.khjbxriag54e"><span class="c25 c37 c23">Occurrences - optional not harvested into the graph</span></h2><p class="c0"><span class="c18">dwc:</span><span class="c4">occurrenceID</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dwc:individualCount</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dwc:locality</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dwc:decimalLatitude</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dwc:decimalLongitude</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">etc.</span></p><p class="c0 c47"><span class="c4"></span></p><h2 class="c0" id="h.aeh9ke2kkffj"><span class="c25 c37 c23">TraitBank Terms File- one global file for all term mappings (OWL-like)</span></h2><p class="c0"><span class="c4">attribution</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">definition</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">name</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">type</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">uri</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">parent uris</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">synonym of uri</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">units term</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">alias</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">symmetrical assoc</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">inverse of</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">incompatible with clade</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">exclusive to clade</span></p><p class="c0 c47"><span class="c4"></span></p><h2 class="c0" id="h.u0mpvykuqqq9"><span class="c25 c37 c23">TraitBank Reference Hierarchy - one global file for all taxon mappings</span></h2><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dwc:taxonID</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dwc:acceptedNameUsageID</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dwc:parentNameUsageID</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dwc:scientificName</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dwc:canonicalName</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dwc:scientificNameAuthorship</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dwc:taxonRank</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dwc:taxonomicStatus</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dc:source</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dwc:higherClassification</span></p><h2 class="c0 c68" id="h.6wst8q3qzb9d"><span class="c25 c23 c37"></span></h2><h2 class="c0" id="h.gc1qnxets07t"><span class="c25 c37 c23">References - one global file for all sources and references</span></h2><p class="c0"><span class="c4">dc:identifier</span></p><p class="c0"><span class="c18">dc:bibliographicCitation</span></p><h1 class="c51" id="h.2fdczsrpbpbz"><span class="c17">Old Graph Data Model</span></h1><p class="c9"><span class="c19">Data Sources</span><span>: trait data file,</span><span class="c13">&nbsp;EOL managed hierarchy</span><span>, </span><span class="c8">Zenodo record, 